{"data": [{"author_id": "1499097979747291138", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:10:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116639073787912195"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/SmallCapSnipa/…", "end": 220, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/SmallCapSnipa/status/2116542959264969033", "start": 197, "url": "https://t.co/kfFkZZ1irc"}]}, "id": "2116639073787912195", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116542959264969033", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The Nscale one doesn't surprise me. Ran the numbers on a UK compute project last year, industrial power at $0.25 to $0.35/kWh makes most GPU cluster economics fall over before you've hired anyone. https://t.co/kfFkZZ1irc", "url": "https://x.com/chessieowl/status/2116639073787912195"}, {"author_id": "2110111835433082880", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:55:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116650168191959207"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/9Xm0MPMKin", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/UseOffPeak/status/2116650168191959207/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116288036522663936", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/9Xm0MPMKin"}]}, "id": "2116650168191959207", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "52.3% average GPU use. Easy to read as half a cluster sitting free.\n\nThe Philly trace (Microsoft, ATC 2019) measured activity on GPUs already allocated. Available supply is a separate check.\n\nPublished research, not Offpeak results. That's why spare GPUs are worth testing. https://t.co/9Xm0MPMKin", "url": "https://x.com/UseOffPeak/status/2116650168191959207"}, {"author_id": "1971982825663741952", "created_at": "2026-10-31T20:54:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116635035138998763"], "id": "2116635035138998763", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Just pulled the trigger on my budget local AI cluster setup for right around $1000. \n\n2x 2013 12-core Mac Pros + 8x Sun Oracle 32GB  (256GB total RAM), connecting them directly via a 20Gbps Thunderbolt 2 bridge, with Quad 6GB GPU for 24GB VRAM total.\n\nNot much, but it’ll do.", "url": "https://x.com/o_oNexCrafto_o/status/2116635035138998763"}, {"author_id": "1291510399116902402", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:36:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116645386794275077"], "id": "2116645386794275077", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A single B200 is now mining on KubeTEE (SN90), running confidential workloads inside a TEE (a locked part of the chip that proves what code ran).\n\nThat's the product: the subnet scores attested capacity, not tokens. A cluster proves it can schedule confidential GPU jobs, and a", "url": "https://x.com/taoleeh/status/2116645386794275077"}, {"author_id": "1797337858140753920", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:56:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116650611286712473"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 163, "start": 159, "tag": "NRV"}, {"end": 168, "start": 164, "tag": "SUI"}, {"end": 173, "start": 169, "tag": "SOL"}]}, "id": "2116650611286712473", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "Let's dive into the world of decentralized worker nodes! These nodes harness green GPU compute and hardware to securely power AI training on Sui &amp; Solana. $NRV $SUI $SOL", "url": "https://x.com/KrasaLuxury/status/2116650611286712473"}, {"author_id": "1299699294", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:48:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116648619319136701"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/elonmusk/statu…", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/2116596535433871630", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/ebvVUV3rMb"}]}, "id": "2116648619319136701", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116596535433871630", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Elon Musk says Colossus 2 in Memphis is targeting roughly 1.2 MILLION NVIDIA Blackwell GPUs by year-end.\n\nThe campus breakdown:\n\n• Macrohard: 110K GB200s + 220K GB300s\n• Macroharder: 220K GB300s for training\n• Minihard: 220K GB300s for training, operational since October\n• https://t.co/ebvVUV3rMb", "url": "https://x.com/SatyaOnMarkets/status/2116648619319136701"}, {"author_id": "1977011373805830144", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:42:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116646989391929474"], "id": "2116646989391929474", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Call to Action: Superintelligence Data &amp; AI Partnerships\n\nXpert Systems Inc. is looking for Neo Labs, AI Labs, funded startups, public software companies, Enterprise AI companies, data owners, and technology partners that want to build the next generation of specialized AI", "url": "https://x.com/Pradeep891730/status/2116646989391929474"}, {"author_id": "1619657658432389120", "created_at": "2026-10-31T21:40:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116646623317271016"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/vt1Ofvp3NB", "end": 292, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/samstar71_/status/2116646623317271016/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116646613037068288", "start": 269, "url": "https://t.co/vt1Ofvp3NB"}, {"display_url": "x.com/samstar71_/sta…", "end": 316, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/samstar71_/status/2116215156577542645", "start": 293, "url": "https://t.co/rtn65Tr0kb"}]}, "id": "2116646623317271016", "public_metrics": {"bookmar